      "content": "i mean, i know i should rest, but even when i'm home, it's like i can't escape it. everything just feels so heavy. like, what's the point of even trying to maintain everything when you see how quickly it all falls apart? it feels like we're all just fighting a losing battle against total chaos. it's so exhausting to keep pretending there's a way to win.",
